WEBVTT

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:13.950
Who will win this close race?

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.060
The clean-cut businessman from Nakamura District 4 takes the lead!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:19.240
However, the high school girl, Satomi, overtakes him!

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.500
Whoa, what was that?

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.910
It's the Masked Taxi Rider!

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.860
The Best of the Circuit, first in history to be licensed for two-wheeled public transportation!

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.310
Chill, I'm not in <i>that </i>much of a hurry!

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.130
I <i>can't</i> drive slowly!

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.700
I feel like I'm going crazy

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:58.160
I like nice songs

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:02.630
and I want you to listen to them too

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:07.630
Whenever

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:13.260
I sing a song

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.850
I hear a voice coming from the microphone

00:01:16.850 --> 00:01:19.310
wishing me the best

00:01:19.310 --> 00:01:22.020
I want you

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:23.560
to hear it too

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:24.440
Good luck!

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:28.400
You can't show your love

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.120
just with niceties

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:39.000
That won't provide comfort

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:43.250
Whenever I say something

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:49.300
out of the ordinary

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.760
in my heart

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.260
I wish you the best

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:57.810
I want you

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:59.430
to hear that line

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:00.430
Good luck!

